Counter_Name        :	FETCH_SIZE
Description         :	The total kilobytes fetched from the video memory. This is measured with all extra fetches and any cache or memory effects taken into account.
Expression          :	(TCC_BUBBLE_sum*128 + (TCC_EA0_RDREQ_sum-TCC_BUBBLE_sum-TCC_EA0_RDREQ_32B_sum)*64 + TCC_EA0_RDREQ_32B_sum*32)/1024
SPM                 :	Not Supported
Dimensions          :	DIMENSION_INSTANCE[0:0]


Counter_Name        :	BANDWIDTH_EA
Description         :	Memory Bandwidth measured at the TCC_EA interface. In units of bytes/cycle.
Expression          :	(WRITE_SIZE*1024+TCC_BUBBLE_sum*128+(TCC_EA0_RDREQ_sum-TCC_BUBBLE_sum)*64)/reduce(GRBM_GUI_ACTIVE,max)
SPM                 :	Not Supported
Dimensions          :	DIMENSION_INSTANCE[0:0]


Counter_Name        :	FetchSize
Description         :	The total kilobytes fetched from the video memory. This is measured with all extra fetches and any cache or memory effects taken into account.
Expression          :	FETCH_SIZE
SPM                 :	Not Supported
Dimensions          :	DIMENSION_INSTANCE[0:0]


